    {
      "text": "Drain juice from pineapple into a microwave-safe bowl; set fruit aside. Warm juice in the microwave for 1 minute. Stir in Jell-O gelatin until dissolved; set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/nhJS49wpiO7xsMlO3D6kQJJ36Ns=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12478-jims-pineapple-cheese-pie-VAT-006-step-02-4f889454859342f0b4123a0b96f8e745.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12478/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat cream cheese and whipped topping in a large bowl until smooth. Mix in crushed pineapple. Stir in gelatin mixture until well-combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/j4nlWLS7pLlwXs6Uh3-4dY3RBv4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/12478-jims-pineapple-cheese-pie-VAT-007-step-03-81ff32cd65e6457cad2e23494aa4a379.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/12478/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour into baked pie shell. Chill in the refrigerator until filling is set, 4 to 5 hours.",
